# Ceiling, not an exact pin: setuptools>=82 fully removed the pkg_resources
# module (verified directly - `import pkg_resources` succeeds, with a
# deprecation warning, on 81.0.0, and fails outright with
# ModuleNotFoundError on every 82.0.0+ release tried). semgrep's own
# transitive dependency opentelemetry-instrumentation-requests still does
# `from pkg_resources import (...)` at import time, so any setuptools>=82
# breaks `semgrep scan` before it even runs (confirmed - a Dependabot bump
# to 84.0.0 did exactly this, PR #21). Raise this ceiling once semgrep's
# own dependency chain moves off pkg_resources, not before - a real render
# of `semgrep scan`, not just `pip install`, is what would actually prove
# that.
setuptools>=81.0.0,<82
semgrep==1.136.0
